  "definition": "open = weights downloadable under any licence (including non-commercial). closed = API-only, weights not published. unknown = cannot be determined (cloaked/stealth pre-release models). other = the aggregated remainder bucket a gateway itself reports (OpenRouter 'other' top-50 truncation, Vercel 'Other' row) which cannot be classified.",
  "decisions": [
    "gpt-oss counts as open weight even though OpenAI is otherwise closed (tagged per model).",
    "Mistral is tagged per model: released-weights models are open, API-only models (Large, Medium, Codestral 25xx, Ministral 3B, legacy Small/small-latest) are closed.",
    "Cohere Command-R family is open (weights downloadable, CC-BY-NC); Cohere North platform models are closed.",
    "OpenRouter cloaked models (openrouter/*-alpha, stealth/*) are unknown, not guessed."
  ],
